      "content": "The idea that everything is fundamentally broken is a very powerful, and very understandable, conclusion when facing such a massive loss. If the path you built your entire life around has vanished, the sheer exhaustion of continuing can feel overwhelming. When the struggle feels this absolute, the most logical next step is to let the weight drop, and that means letting yourself be completely and utterly taken care of by an outside force.",
